FAQ
===
Q: What about long filenames?
A: The code uses the psion 3 communication protocol. The psion 5 has a "back compatibility" mode which lets it use the same protocol. Unfortunately the psion 3 had "dos like filenames" - which means that until somebody writes a document describing the updated 5 protocol we're stuck with it. (I would still support the 3 protocol too.)

Q: Where did you get this protocol description document?
A: From Olaf Flebbe. The URL is http://www.science-computing.de/~flebbe/psion/

Q: Which compiler do you use?
A: I use gcc 2.8.1 and libstdc++ 2.8.1.1. If you port the code to another compiler/ OS, then please e-mail me
the changes.

Q: I like the way you code. Can I offer you a job with a six figure salary? (not Yen)
A: No, but ask my wife - she's a hard worker, and very generous to family!